            "paragraph": "In this section, the CFSv2 model with an initial month of June is used as an example to conduct an in-depth evaluation of model reliability, bias and skill by pooling all grid cells under investigation. Figure 3 presents the reliability comparison results of raw forecasts, calibrated forecasts, and climatological forecasts across three lead times. For the three forecast targets, the \u03b1-index of the raw forecasts ranges from 0 to 1, with median values below 0.65 (specifically, 0.65, 0.55, and 0.47 for the respective lead times).",
